			"notes": "# Changelog: Tessera v0.3.1 (1.21 – 26.3)\n\nThis update fixes a grey bar that appeared next to the crosshair.\n\n---\n\n## Key Features & Changes\n\n* **Crosshair Fixed**: The crosshair no longer shows a grey bar beside it. Tessera now leaves the small interface texture atlas alone, so every menu, hotbar and HUD sprite is drawn exactly as in vanilla. The saving lost is about a megabyte of video memory.\n* **Same On Every Version**: The fix applies to every supported Minecraft version, 1.21 – 1.21.11 and 26.1 – 26.3.\n\n---\n\n## Downloads\n\nMost players should install Tessera from [Modrinth](https://modrinth.com/mod/olpctCIW) or [CurseForge](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tessera) (launchers update it for you). The files below are the same release, for manual installs and developers.\n\n### Minecraft 1.21–1.21.4\n\n| File | For |\n|---|---|\n| `tessera-0.3.1+1.21.1.jar` | Every system (recommended) |\n| `tessera-0.3.1+1.21.1-windows.jar` | Windows only |\n| `tessera-0.3.1+1.21.1-linux.jar` | Linux only |\n| `tessera-0.3.1+1.21.1-java.jar` | Pure Java (no native libraries) only |\n| `tessera-0.3.1+1.21.1-sources.jar` | Source code, for developers |\n\n### Minecraft 1.21.5–1.21.10\n\n| File | For |\n|---|---|\n| `tessera-0.3.1+1.21.10.jar` | Every system (recommended) |\n| `tessera-0.3.1+1.21.10-windows.jar` | Windows only |\n| `tessera-0.3.1+1.21.10-linux.jar` | Linux only |\n| `tessera-0.3.1+1.21.10-java.jar` | Pure Java (no native libraries) only |\n| `tessera-0.3.1+1.21.10-sources.jar` | Source code, for developers |\n\n### Minecraft 1.21.11\n\n| File | For |\n|---|---|\n| `tessera-0.3.1+1.21.11.jar` | Every system (recommended) |\n| `tessera-0.3.1+1.21.11-windows.jar` | Windows only |\n| `tessera-0.3.1+1.21.11-linux.jar` | Linux only |\n| `tessera-0.3.1+1.21.11-java.jar` | Pure Java (no native libraries) only |\n| `tessera-0.3.1+1.21.11-sources.jar` | Source code, for developers |\n\n### Minecraft 26.1–26.3\n\n| File | For |\n|---|---|\n| `tessera-0.3.1+26.1.jar` | Every system (recommended) |\n| `tessera-0.3.1+26.1-windows.jar` | Windows only |\n| `tessera-0.3.1+26.1-linux.jar` | Linux only |\n| `tessera-0.3.1+26.1-java.jar` | Pure Java (no native libraries) only |\n| `tessera-0.3.1+26.1-sources.jar` | Source code, for developers |\n\nPer-system files are the universal jar with only that system's native libraries; they behave identically on it. The pure-Java file has no native libraries and runs the Java fallbacks everywhere.\n\nVerify downloads with `SHA256SUMS.txt`."
		},
